        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>How does line of sight work when the line between two hexes crosses &quot;blank&quot; space. &nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Is the blank space treated as elevation 0 (doesn&#39;t interfere with line of sight at all) or as elevation infinity (blocks all line of sight)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>For an example, consider Baron Blade Scenario 1. A line from the north end of tile 1 to the north end of tile 2 crosses an area with no map tiles. &nbsp;(assume north towards the top of the page, if you are looking at the map in the scenario guide)</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "actions_summary": [],
